<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SYNTHESIA PRELIM H1 GROSS DIPS.</title>
<headline>CZECH SYNTHESIA PRELIM H1 GROSS DIPS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech chemical conglomerate Synthesia a.s., majority owned by Chemapol Group a.s., said on Monday that its first-half preliminary pre-tax profit fell to 33.5 million crowns from 45.025 million for the first six months of last year.  </p>
<p> pre-tax profit (czk mln)	33.521  vs     45.025</p>
<p> operating profit		 191.714  vs    182.842</p>
<p> writeoffs			  250.647  vs    228.175</p>
<p> sales of own goods/serv.   2,890.031  vs  2,803.676</p>
<p> sales of other goods	    86.721  vs     62.454</p>
<p> basic capital		  5,713.319  vs  5,713.319</p>
<p> assets			  12,068.913  vs 11,651.597</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
